@startuml binding_step_5_methods
title Step 5: Implement Method Path

participant "Proxy method" as proxy
participant "Method transport" as transport
participant "Skeleton method handler" as skeleton

proxy -> transport : call(request)
transport -> skeleton : enqueue(request)
skeleton -> skeleton : invoke handler
skeleton --> transport : response or error
transport --> proxy : response or error

note over transport
Define request/response ownership,
queue limits, timeout behavior,
error mapping, and restart behavior.
end note
@enduml
